(What I want Bwiza Jewels to become) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I want Bwiza Jewels to grow into a brand that people can recognize, not just a product they) Tj T*
(buy once. The goal is to make sustainable accessories attractive enough that people choose) Tj T*
(them because they look good and carry meaning, not only because they are described as) Tj T*
(environmentally friendly.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Starting with bamboo, the brand can gradually explore organic beads and other materials,) Tj T*
(serve both local and international customers, create opportunities for local production, and) Tj T*
(build practical alternatives to plastic bands. The bigger idea is simple: sustainability) Tj T*
(should still feel beautiful.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(We want people to keep the memory, not the plastic.) Tj T*
